  "storyId": "main_2_level_main_02-06_beg",
  "groupId": "main_2",
  "stageId": "main_02-06",
  "title": "Hold on Tight",
  "storyCode": "2-6",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4b49ea6ffee910fb1a8f51931680af3a949dcda175d2b5e493f9d31b390d1f3a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十八关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Here we are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "--? !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "We have to go up to the rooftop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...This door is locked."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Stand back, I'll blast it open--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "There's no need for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Just kick it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Liskarm, you should learn from her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "I have my own way of doing things. Got a problem with that?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "There's another rooftop in front of us..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I think I'm beginning to understand..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Amiya, over there! You'll be able to cross over from there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Where is 'there'... Are you telling us to--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Jump from rooftop to rooftop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Bingo~!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who would ever expect this? See, this is foolproof!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You know, Lungmen is a great place with many secrets--"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're not getting away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Huh? What's going on? !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Exusiai, the enemy showed up unexpectedly..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "I already sealed off the entrance, so how..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Could they have come from the nearby buildings..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "They seem to be wearing some rudimentary jetpack, but it's enough to get the job done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "We'd be at a disadvantage if they managed to sneak through places we aren't able to defend..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tch... Hold on, I'll be there to help you shortly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Don't take too long, my little guardian angel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "Defenders, get into formation! Pronto!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "...I'm going in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Everyone, protect our vanguard!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
